---
import { SITE_NAME, SITE_TAGLINE, getGithubRepo } from '../lib/config';

const repo = getGithubRepo();
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="mt-16 border-t border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 bg-surface-raised">
  <div class="container-page grid gap-8 py-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    <div>
      <p class="text-base font-bold">{SITE_NAME}</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink-muted">{SITE_TAGLINE}</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-ink-faint">
        Nội dung demo mang tính minh họa. Lyrics thật chỉ được đăng khi có nguồn và credits đầy đủ.
      </p>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Liên kết chân trang">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Khám phá</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-muted">
        <li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/search/">Tìm kiếm</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/corrections/">Gửi correction</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/content-policy/">Chính sách nội dung</a></li>
        <li><a class="hover:text-ink" href="/sitemap.xml">Sitemap</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold">Nguồn dữ liệu</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-muted">
        {
          repo ? (
            <li>
              <a
                class="hover:text-ink"
                href={`https://github.com/${repo}`}
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                target="_blank"
              >
                GitHub repository ↗
              </a>
            </li>
          ) : (
            <li class="text-ink-faint">Chưa cấu hình PUBLIC_GITHUB_REPO.</li>
          )
        }
        <li>Decap CMS: <a class="hover:text-ink" href="/admin/">/admin/</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-black/10 dark:border-white/10 py-4">
    <p class="container-page text-xs text-ink-faint">
      © {year} {SITE_NAME}. Dữ liệu nội dung lưu trong Git (JSON) — không dùng database.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
